WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:02.350
It's going away...

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.230
W-What's going away?

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:07.660
The shop!

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.560
Our home!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:16.490
They said they're redeveloping the slums 
and started tearing down buildings!

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.810
They'll be tearing down the neighborhood 
where we live in a week, they said!

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:22.870
What do we do?

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.200
What do we do, Eve?

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:02.080
Beep beep!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.980
Under construction!

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.350
We're making a new house.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:08.170
It's dangerous to be here, kids.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.480
Go somewhere else.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:15.670
We'll have to leave.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:19.040
If the authorities find us, we'll be fine,

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:23.080
but those kids are immigrant 
orphans. They'll be deported.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:27.710
But where do we go?

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:32.130
We've been giving money to Mr. Carossa 
to have him leave us alone, but...

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.330
There aren't any other 
towns where we could do that!

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:37.540
We can't just move?

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.250
Using the money we've made.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.120
I know you've worked so hard 
to make the money, Eve,

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.250
but it's not enough.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:53.120
Nobody would want to rent to a 
bunch of scary weirdos like us, anyway.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.680
If we could've moved, we already would have!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:00.040
...from this shithole of a town!

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:05.000
Want to just run away 
and live in the mountains?

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.160
If the six of us work together...

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:12.780
If somebody finds us 
and calls the cops, it'll be all over!

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:16.360
Why don't we go back to Norman

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.080
and have him let us 
live there while we work?

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:19.880
No.

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:23.640
It's okay. I'm not a kid anymore.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.050
I can take it.

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.050
That's not what I meant.

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.920
All the illegal shops are being shut down.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.320
Why?

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:38.150
I heard the mafia's involved 
in this redevelopment project.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:39.600
The mafia?

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:40.690
Yes.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:46.100
And when it's done, people under 
their influence will control the town.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:49.370
And they'll get rid 
of anyone who's in their way.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:55.400
What jackass wanted to 
turn this place into a casino?

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:57.080
A casino?

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.710
At stake is the land deed,

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:03.080
as well as rights to control 
the casino built on the land itself.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:05.300
The winner of the golf match gets both.

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:08.800
No... that can't be!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:10.210
Eve!

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:12.280
Where are you going?

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.520
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.200
It's Eve!

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.750
Where are you going?

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:24.580
Work?

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:27.170
Yeah.

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:28.870
I-I'll be back later.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.870
Bye!

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.540
<i>We're losing our home...</i>

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:40.540
<i>And it's my fault!</i>

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:50.390
As planned, my company has purchased all 
the land where the casino will be built.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.510
We just need the Council's approval.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:57.900
<i>I'm counting on you, 
Upper Council Member Stein.</i>

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.550
Leave it to me, Madame.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:04.020
Make sure I get my kickback.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.530
<i>Rebellion's Cry</i>

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:08.990
What's going on?!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:13.870
If I'd known we were losing the shop, 
I'd never have agreed!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:17.480
Hey, yelling at me won't 
solve your problems.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:20.600
The casino would've been built anyway.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.090
It just happened a little earlier 
than it would've otherwise.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.030
Why didn't you tell me?

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:27.080
'cause it was none of your business.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:27.840
Listen.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:34.220
You're the one who owed me a favor 
'cause I let you fight that Japanese girl.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:40.360
I just had you repay that 
favor by playing a golf match.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:43.700
This was your idea to begin with,

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.700
so don't complain now!

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.530
Is that all you need?

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.710
Then leave.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:53.160
You're interrupting my work.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:58.260
You know, Madame Catherine was saying

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:01.380
she wanted you to be her 
exclusive golfer for betting golf.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:06.880
I bet if you said yes, she'd give you 
and your friends a place to live.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:13.730
Of course, that would mean 
getting in deep with the mafia.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:16.560
So deep that you'll never get out.

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:27.190
What was her problem?

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:28.820
No idea.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.440
She was probably just in a bad mood.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.880
<i>Now, the die is cast.</i>

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:41.330
<i>What choice you make, 
what path you follow, is up to you now.</i>

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.640
<i>We'll have to leave.</i>

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:57.390
<i>Madame Catherine was saying she wanted you 
to be her exclusive golfer for betting golf.</i>

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.610
<i>This time, keep your promise.</i>

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:04.970
<i>Of course, that would mean 
getting in deep with the mafia.</i>

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:09.500
<i>They'll be tearing down the neighborhood 
where we live in a week, they said!</i>

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.580
A week, huh?

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.360
Well, we've got our backs against a cliff...

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.990
A cliff that's a sheer 
drop of a million feet...

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:22.240
But I won't give up.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.840
Until the very last moment.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.130
What do you want?

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:30.680
Snake Woman!

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:32.960
My name is Vipère!

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.620
I see.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.880
So that's where your hideout is?

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.260
I need a golf bet that pays well.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:45.450
Please, introduce me to one.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:49.160
If I had a job like that, 
I'd just do it myself!

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:52.410
The jobs with good pay all 
had to do with the casino,

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.210
so there won't be any for a while.

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:58.040
Of course, if there was a war between 
the mafias, things would be different.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.400
Then loan me money. I'll pay back!

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:04.080
I don't have money!

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:16.000
Nicolas's men took everything 
I had after I lost to you!

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:20.450
They could've killed me!

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.730
That's how important that match was!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.730
Why didn't they kill you, then?

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:27.250
Why? Well, because...

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.710
Um...

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:29.810
Why, I wonder?

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.200
That's strange.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:37.310
Nicolas lost access to a casino 
that would've made him a fortune.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:38.810
So why?

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:42.240
Where are we going?

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:43.750
Get out.

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:48.500
I'm going home. There's 
something I need to look into.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.680
I'll call you when I'm done.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:52.250
H-Hey!

00:08:54.150 --> 00:09:00.720
Maybe the war for the 
casino isn't over after all?

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:06.070
Tomorrow's council meeting 
will be fine, won't it?

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.080
Yes.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.650
We've gotten informal okays 
from 60 members.

00:09:14.690 --> 00:09:16.260
S-Sir!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:17.870
No!

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:30.040
What? Council Member Stein is...?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.420
<i>Yes! They blew up his car!</i>

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.010
No!

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.350
T-Trouble, madame!

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:37.680
What is it now?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.080
T-They forced through a City Council meeting

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:43.960
and are handing over the rights 
to the casino to the Nicolas Company!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:48.570
W-What did you say?

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:53.560
That man!

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:59.480
Too bad, Madame Catherine.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.260
I'm so surprised that the rights 
to the casino ended up with me.

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.000
<i>Don't play dumb!</i>

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:07.910
You stole them!

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:10.180
<i>"Steal"? Nonsense.</i>

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:13.870
<i>The council simply recognized 
my company's excellence.</i>

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:15.710
Give them back!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.420
<i>Or do you want a war that badly?</i>

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.180
Not at all!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:26.480
But we've put a lot of money 
into getting those rights.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:32.560
How about we run it together?

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:37.360
Spilt the profits, say... 70-30?

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.800
<i>Screw you!</i>

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.450
You sure about this, boss?

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.200
This means war...

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:46.940
No need to worry.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:49.460
The time and place for the 
meeting has already been set.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:52.710
The big bosses will work it all out.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.470
You had all this prepared in advance?

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:59.000
I always repay my debts.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:03.360
You can't be in the mafia if you don't.

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:07.740
Congratulations on your 
victory, Miss Amawashi!

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:13.480
On the last day, what hole were you 
on when you realized you'd won?

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:18.110
I couldn't be sure until 
the last play of the last hole.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:20.480
Even with a 12 stroke 
lead on your opponents?

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.370
Yes! I needed to catch up to her!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.240
Catch up?

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.720
It feels like we're talking 
about two different things...

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:31.240
Dumb girl...

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.380
Aoi Amawashi

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.380
What were you doing out there?

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.850
I told you to forget about Eve Aleon!

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:40.170
Yeah. Sorry, Amane.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:45.600
Understood.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:50.140
<i>Eve hasn't logged in since then.</i>

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:53.470
<i>I want to hear her answer to my promise.</i>

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:05.200
I'm out of cash to bet.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.880
That's all I can do for today.

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:10.620
Okay, see you next time!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.620
Eve, let's call it a day!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.760
We've been playing all day.

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:18.700
Let's keep it up.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:20.080
I need to make as much as I can.

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:24.300
You can't make money if you 
collapse from exhaustion, Eve!

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.140
Don't make me take too many risks for you.

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:40.140
Sorry!

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.480
I see.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.400
So they're after the casino rights.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:47.940
There's a meeting with 
the big bosses on both sides.

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:52.530
Since this dispute started with a golf match, 
they want to end it with one.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:56.910
Hey, can you let me be in charge of it?

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.040
You lost last time.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:03.620
And that's why I'll introduce you 
to the perfect golfer.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.310
And if you do...

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.540
Y-You can't...

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:12.450
Come on! Please!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:16.450
B-But Nicolas is my boss, 
and I don't know what—

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:22.490
If you help me, I'll show you 
some of my most special techniques.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:24.240
Done. I'm in.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:26.410
I love you!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.000
I love you too!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.810
A golf match!

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:35.810
And on my course, too!

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:39.320
The big boss is such a great negotiator.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:42.460
Madame, Rose is here.

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:44.880
Hey, Madame.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:48.190
Rose, we're having 
another golf match, right?

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:51.000
That girl... Eve, was it?

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:52.530
Bring her to me now.

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:53.580
Impossible.

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:54.400
Why?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:59.530
Turns out her home's located 
on the grounds for the casino.

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:03.360
She's quite upset with 
the both of us at the moment.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.430
What?

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:07.690
If she wants a house, I'll give her one.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:12.810
She's not the type who'll do what 
you want if you give her a treat.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.340
If someone starts a fight, she finishes it.

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:20.230
And we've already started a fight with her.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:23.330
A golf match?

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:24.640
Yes.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:28.540
With a once-in-a-lifetime paycheck, too.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:34.930
We could split the reward and you'd 
still have enough to buy that yacht.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:39.320
But if you lose, you 
and I are both dead women.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:41.190
Well? You in?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.680
Why are you coming to me?

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:46.480
You and I both want money.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:49.050
And since you beat me,

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:51.360
if you play, we're more likely to win.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.780
And...

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.150
And?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.400
I want to see you play golf again.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.750
I don't want to get my friends involved.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:04.360
Will you be my caddy?

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:06.600
Of course. With pleasure.

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:08.350
Thank you, Snake Woman.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.920
Vipère!

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:12.200
Learn my name already!

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:14.500
Sorry about that, Snake Woman.

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:16.480
<i>Vipère!</i>

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.630
I guess I'll have to sell them.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:24.890
Robert's a fellow Gunpla lover!

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:27.080
He'll pay me a lot!

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:30.070
Farewell, my Gunpla!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.990
This, and this...

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:36.160
Preparing to flee in the night?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.680
Rose?

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.320
Um, Eve's not here.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.630
I know.

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:44.880
There's one thing I wanted to tell you.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:46.750
What?

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:50.840
Eve won't be coming back for a while.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:54.850
So stay here up until the last second 
before the construction starts.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:57.750
Why?

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:01.670
If the construction workers 
call the cops on us, we'll be—

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:03.580
Maybe.

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:06.280
But stay here and wait 
for Eve until the last second.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.240
Bye.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:10.560
I doubt we'll ever meet again.

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:15.640
Rose!

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:19.950
Rose...

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.670
What are you trying to do with Eve?

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:25.080
What are you trying to make her do?

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.280
<i>What are you...?</i>

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.840
<i>The match is in 4 days.</i>

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:39.350
<i>No time to learn new skills.</i>

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:45.820
<i>All you can do in that time 
is improve the skills you have.</i>

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:49.800
<i>Remind yourself of what 
you can and can't do.</i>

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:52.570
<i>Improve your physical conditioning.</i>

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:56.570
<i>Focus your mind and 
improve your concentration.</i>

00:16:56.570 --> 00:17:00.160
<i>And more than anything...</i>

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.360
<i>Stay greedy.</i>

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.920
<i>Remember what you can't let yourself lose.</i>

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.090
<i>And what you want more than anything.</i>

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:14.420
<i>Keep them in your mind.</i>

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:15.790
<i>They're...</i>

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.350
<i>The vision that leads you to success.</i>

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:29.320
That was some tough training.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:31.490
You've got stamina.

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.390
I've done stuff ten times worse than you.

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:35.860
Ten times?!

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:38.380
What kind of training do you do?

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:42.920
I just did what I was told to.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:44.950
Three Years Ago

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.840
Pierce your opponent's heart 
clean through with a single shot.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:53.160
Destroy them mentally.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:56.390
Make it so they'll never 
want to face you again.

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.640
Load the bullet.

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.060
Cock the hammer.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.390
Aim.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.310
Pull the trigger.

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:08.270
And fire it from the barrel!

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:13.400
It was pretty rough...

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:16.280
And that was your coach?

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.040
Hell if I know.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.440
My memories from back then are pretty hazy.

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:21.650
What?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.920
Oh, I have no memories of my childhood.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.130
The first thing I remember clearly 
is being saved by the friends I have now.

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:44.590
What were you doing there?

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.100
Why were you hurt so bad?

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:49.480
I don't know.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.220
Are your parents around?

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:54.520
I don't know.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.140
Where's your home?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.400
I don't know.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.660
What's your name?

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:08.050
Evangeline...

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:09.220
And your last name?

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.850
I don't know.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:26.400
All I could remember was 
that my name was Evangeline...

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.020
Eve.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.850
Klein took me in.

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.390
And when the wounds on my head healed,

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:39.270
a guy named Leo showed up and said to me

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:42.040
that if I would study golf with him,

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:45.030
he'd pay for me and my 
friends' living expenses.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:50.040
I picked the basics up quick. 
I don't know why.

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:53.040
But three years of that...

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:56.910
And Leo just disappeared.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:02.040
That's why I started playing betting golf, 
to make enough money to live.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.130
And that's how I ended up here.

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:08.720
T-That's quite a life.

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:13.890
Klein and Lily's lives 
were way worse than mine.

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:20.110
When I woke up, 
Klein was 14. And Lily was 10.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.160
And the job they were doing...

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.780
I wanted to do something.

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:31.470
I'd only ever been taught golf. 
Golf was all I could do.

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:37.050
So I had to forge a life for myself 
and my friends... with golf!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:38.800
<i>And...</i>

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:43.830
<i>No, you need to forget her for now, Eve!</i>

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:46.260
<i>For now, just focus on your friends!</i>

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:51.210
<i>To pay them back 
for all they've done for you.</i>

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:59.160
<i>Whatever comes, I'll pierce it through...</i>

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.370
<i>With my Rainbow Bullet!</i>

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:35.240
I'm amazed you had the guts 
to show up here...

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:38.460
After you tricked me!

00:22:38.770 --> 00:22:44.530
I recommend being mad 
at your own stupidity, not me.

00:22:47.310 --> 00:22:49.870
So, who's your golfer?

00:22:49.870 --> 00:22:52.290
That snake girl again?

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:53.410
No.

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:56.060
We've brought someone special.

00:22:56.960 --> 00:22:57.810
Me!

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:02.020
I knew it.

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:08.030
Girl, you'll regret messing with me.

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:09.560
I won't regret anything.

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:11.030
I won't need to.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:12.950
I don't know about that.

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:16.870
I've brought someone special myself.

00:23:17.610 --> 00:23:22.000
Looks like we were fated to fight.

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.610
You're the one who set this all up.

00:23:24.610 --> 00:23:25.720
Yep.

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:29.250
So I won't regret anything. I won't need to.

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:31.990
Now let's begin...

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:37.120
The ultimate golf, where both 
of our lives are on the line!

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:49.980
Next Episode

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:41.970
Rose Aleon...

00:23:41.970 --> 00:23:46.810
No matter how good a golfer you are, 
I'll pierce you through!

00:23:46.810 --> 00:23:49.840
With my Rainbow Bullet!
